WEBVTT

00:05.750 --> 00:08.190
You said your name is Ophelia?

00:08.560 --> 00:11.420
Can you bring Chloe back from the dead?

00:12.300 --> 00:14.600
Witches do not lie.

00:18.880 --> 00:22.380
Science revealed humankind's true nature.

00:22.830 --> 00:25.420
Perhaps God created a spherical world

00:25.420 --> 00:28.580
to keep them from seeing 
too far into the distance

00:28.580 --> 00:32.070
because he feared for their future.

00:54.520 --> 00:58.320
I love you, so...

00:59.900 --> 01:01.900
I'm sorry, Chloe.

01:02.660 --> 01:04.830
I won't bring you back to life.

01:07.380 --> 01:10.960
I won't make you feel that way again.

01:13.460 --> 01:14.630
<i>There's no place for you here.</i>

01:15.800 --> 01:17.680
<i>No place for you anywhere, my beloved.</i>

01:23.900 --> 01:26.750
Not in this shitty world.

01:30.050 --> 01:32.820
Nostalgic Memories: Replace.

01:32.530 --> 01:37.030
<b>Nostalgic Memories 
Replace</b>

01:37.960 --> 01:42.060
Did you rewrite the ritual, Adonis?

02:13.440 --> 02:16.980
I didn't want to leave my debt unpaid.

03:53.240 --> 03:55.380
What? You're...

04:02.740 --> 04:07.460
Is this Lunamilia, the witches' nation?

04:08.510 --> 04:11.480
Madam Ophelia and the others...

04:11.480 --> 04:14.550
Huh? What am I doing here?

04:15.180 --> 04:17.150
But I was shot.

04:22.370 --> 04:25.240
I'm naked? Why?

04:25.240 --> 04:29.540
I-I-I-I'm sorry you had to see 
something s-s-so filthy and unsightly.

04:29.540 --> 04:33.770
P-Please erase it from your memories.

04:42.770 --> 04:46.260
Be quiet. Put that on.

04:46.620 --> 04:48.380
You saved me in Redia.

04:48.380 --> 04:50.220
Now we're even.

04:50.830 --> 04:54.490
Um, where is Chloe?

04:56.020 --> 04:57.690
What about Chloe?

04:58.770 --> 05:01.540
How could you, Adonis?

05:01.540 --> 05:06.180
We're doing what we can to help you.

05:06.180 --> 05:10.790
We risked our lives to rescue you 
and we healed your wounds.

05:11.060 --> 05:17.580
We've guaranteed your safety and 
tried to bring Chloe back from the dead.

05:18.170 --> 05:20.320
How could you ruin all our efforts?

05:21.080 --> 05:22.540
How could he?

05:22.540 --> 05:26.440
Ultimately, he's merely human. 
He never loved his master.

05:26.440 --> 05:29.300
Has he abandoned Chloe in favor of Doroka?

05:29.300 --> 05:31.120
Is that true, Doroka?

05:31.120 --> 05:33.800
Did you put some idea in his head?

05:34.770 --> 05:38.480
Tell me, little Doroka.

05:38.870 --> 05:42.060
I-I, um...

05:42.060 --> 05:45.440
Shut your mouths, witches.

05:46.550 --> 05:48.850
I won't resurrect Chloe.

05:48.850 --> 05:50.910
I'm the one who made that decision.

05:53.370 --> 05:54.950
Honestly.

05:55.490 --> 05:58.240
Who are you showing off for?

05:58.240 --> 06:00.710
Boy...

06:00.710 --> 06:03.300
You're merely human.

06:09.500 --> 06:11.480
What's this? Could it be?

06:12.540 --> 06:14.140
But how?

06:14.140 --> 06:18.390
Adonis, did you do something?

06:18.390 --> 06:23.080
Sorry. I'm a long-term prisoner.

06:24.780 --> 06:28.270
I'll hunt down the humans myself.

06:28.270 --> 06:30.050
You stay out of this.

06:48.640 --> 06:49.740
The mito...

06:50.280 --> 06:52.710
The mito is burning.

06:55.880 --> 06:57.420
A witches' tree...

06:58.070 --> 07:00.440
I had no idea there was one remaining here.

07:01.210 --> 07:02.120
But...

07:02.440 --> 07:04.220
Immolation complete.

07:04.220 --> 07:06.480
<i>Scan of unidentified dome interior complete.</i>

07:06.480 --> 07:08.090
<i>Suitable oxygen levels.</i>

07:08.090 --> 07:10.310
<i>Protective face guard may be removed.</i>

07:11.990 --> 07:15.450
National Security Bureau Director

07:11.990 --> 07:15.450
Senior Director Yamato

07:20.690 --> 07:25.770
The last of an evil race and their
 apprentice... You're all rats in a cage.

07:26.350 --> 07:31.120
How can you say that
when I invited you here...

07:31.960 --> 07:33.770
to this graveyard?

07:35.040 --> 07:37.620
Don't worry, Madam Ophelia.

07:38.340 --> 07:40.680
Extinguish the mito.

07:41.000 --> 07:43.350
Water Magic: Miral!

07:45.310 --> 07:47.360
<b>Water Magic
Miral</b>

07:47.610 --> 07:49.440
Ice Witch
\h\h\h\hAurea

07:48.590 --> 07:49.870
I'll handle this.

07:55.240 --> 07:56.550
Transport complete.

07:56.550 --> 07:58.360
Presence of numerous witches confirmed.

08:11.380 --> 08:12.860
Santa Maria!

08:13.260 --> 08:15.150
Yes, Madam Ophelia.

08:15.990 --> 08:18.280
Enhancement Magic: Reversi!

08:17.220 --> 08:19.010
Enhancement Witch
\h\h\h\hSanta Maria

08:31.150 --> 08:32.800
We'll take them down!

08:34.860 --> 08:38.600
Let's go, everyone.

08:40.990 --> 08:43.070
Written-Style Summoning Magic:

08:46.980 --> 08:47.880
Fal.

08:49.170 --> 08:51.130
<b>Fal</b>

08:58.280 --> 08:59.800
So powerful.

09:05.910 --> 09:07.320
How careless of me.

09:07.320 --> 09:09.320
<i>Deploying defensive gear.</i>

09:13.250 --> 09:17.940
<i>Warning: Damage level rising. 
Damage level rising.</i>

09:17.940 --> 09:22.270
What's wrong? Stand up, you hothead.

09:23.580 --> 09:26.060
Didn't you come here to kill me?

09:28.810 --> 09:29.620
Huh?

09:34.970 --> 09:35.630
What?

09:37.760 --> 09:40.800
Gem Witch
\h\h\h\hCrystal Maya

09:39.080 --> 09:41.600
Gem Magic: Amethyst Dress.

09:43.650 --> 09:45.660
Whoa! What is this?

09:45.660 --> 09:47.110
I can't move!

09:49.040 --> 09:50.680
It keeps growing!

09:51.950 --> 09:53.480
It's no use!

09:53.480 --> 09:54.820
I can't breathe...

10:00.160 --> 10:03.200
Venom-Fang Witch
\h\h\h\h\hDakya

10:00.380 --> 10:04.040
I am Dakya, the Venom-Fang 
Witch. Here I come.

10:04.460 --> 10:06.970
Venom-Fang Magic: Snake God!

10:19.930 --> 10:22.970
Swarm Witch
 Greeana

10:21.360 --> 10:24.890
Swarm Magic: Human Hotel.

10:38.740 --> 10:40.400
Natural Law Magic...

10:41.640 --> 10:42.760
Keep your distance!

10:42.760 --> 10:44.300
Watch for openings!

10:53.600 --> 10:55.920
Her! Shoot her!

11:01.300 --> 11:02.550
What?!

11:11.380 --> 11:13.200
Death Game.

11:14.400 --> 11:15.690
<b>Death Game</b>

11:20.640 --> 11:25.300
Humans are so feeble, like infants.

11:25.700 --> 11:28.930
I believe victory shall be ours, everyone.

11:37.120 --> 11:39.810
Squad 2, transport successful.

11:42.770 --> 11:44.820
I see...

11:44.820 --> 11:48.170
They aim to outnumber us.

11:55.520 --> 12:02.670
So, why are there still so many witches 
when we wiped them out?

12:02.650 --> 12:07.820
National Science Agency Director

12:02.650 --> 12:07.820
Theta Samanstah

12:04.110 --> 12:07.820
Months to live due to DAM exposure

12:07.820 --> 12:10.160
Proceed with your explanation,

12:10.160 --> 12:12.740
Director Theta of the 
National Science Agency.

12:12.370 --> 12:15.830
National Authority Bureau Director
\h\h\h\h\hDynasma

12:16.060 --> 12:17.030
Yes, sir.

12:21.080 --> 12:25.840
This is model Dash-89.

12:26.090 --> 12:31.380
It was a physical transfer 
prototype dumped into space

12:31.380 --> 12:35.850
after its use during 
the witch extermination operation.

12:37.400 --> 12:44.210
However, as you can see from this image, 
we believe the witches captured it.

12:44.210 --> 12:50.870
In other words, they used our science 
to flee beyond the skies?

12:51.670 --> 12:52.570
Yes.

12:53.410 --> 12:56.620
I apologize for not discovering this sooner.

12:57.600 --> 13:01.910
And that structure they built 
on the moon was hidden

13:01.910 --> 13:06.640
from our astronomical wave 
radar by magical camouflage?

13:07.150 --> 13:08.140
Yes.

13:08.140 --> 13:10.460
You think "yes" will cut it?

13:10.460 --> 13:13.520
The National Science Agency is 
the pride of the four bureaus.

13:13.520 --> 13:16.520
You receive a massive annual budget.

13:16.520 --> 13:19.770
How could you allow this to happen?

13:19.770 --> 13:25.780
The people think the witch 
extermination wars ended ten years ago.

13:26.140 --> 13:31.200
This failure will cost 
more than just your life.

13:31.580 --> 13:34.500
Shut up, fatty.

13:35.540 --> 13:38.480
We can worry about that later.

13:38.490 --> 13:41.140
Let's end this.

13:41.140 --> 13:44.660
People are over witch hunts, right?

13:46.550 --> 13:50.010
National Intelligence Agency Director

13:46.550 --> 13:50.010
Shirousagi

14:10.030 --> 14:14.040
Yuki was always by my side.

14:14.800 --> 14:18.700
When I entered the National 
Security Bureau, so did Yuki.

14:19.400 --> 14:23.360
When I became the director, 
she became the vice-director.

14:24.260 --> 14:26.350
The youngest ever.

14:28.120 --> 14:30.720
My little sister is truly amazing.

14:31.720 --> 14:35.340
Bureaucracy doesn't suit her, 
but she did it anyway.

14:36.320 --> 14:38.560
Director Yamato...

14:39.140 --> 14:41.710
National Science Agency Director Theta.

14:42.060 --> 14:46.720
In that moment, you... you said...

14:47.490 --> 14:49.620
You said everything would be all right.

14:50.120 --> 14:53.590
That we'd be saved if we let 
the National Science Agency handle it.

14:54.080 --> 14:56.020
That's what you said, isn't it?

14:57.040 --> 15:00.580
Yuki is only 14 years old.

15:07.180 --> 15:09.650
Adonis the witch's apprentice...

15:09.650 --> 15:12.280
This is all your fault.

15:12.600 --> 15:13.960
You'll pay for this!

15:14.840 --> 15:18.710
Set arm operating output to 500%.

15:18.710 --> 15:20.520
<i>Output set.</i>

15:27.460 --> 15:29.620
Let the battle resume!

15:29.620 --> 15:31.720
You're one tough bastard.

15:31.720 --> 15:34.800
Just die, you hothead.

15:42.960 --> 15:44.090
Adonis!

15:44.090 --> 15:46.270
You'll be the one who dies!

15:46.270 --> 15:50.180
How could you side 
with the witches as a human?

15:51.100 --> 15:53.710
Idiot, keep your eyes on him!

15:54.100 --> 15:59.620
You heretic!

16:02.250 --> 16:04.600
<i>Once this battle is over...</i>

16:23.160 --> 16:30.050
<i>let's find someplace quiet 
to live together, Yuki.</i>

16:39.980 --> 16:42.560
Anti-Witch Iaigiri:

16:42.990 --> 16:45.510
Scattering Blossoms!

16:48.480 --> 16:50.980
<b>Anti-Witch Iaigiri</b>

16:48.480 --> 16:50.980
<b>Scattering Blossoms</b>

16:58.940 --> 17:01.500
Get behind me, everyone! 
I'll use my gems to—

17:03.000 --> 17:04.000
No!

17:05.920 --> 17:07.080
Oh, my.

17:24.690 --> 17:29.070
I cast my Duplication Magic: 
Death Cancel just in time.

17:29.070 --> 17:31.400
What? Anna?

17:31.400 --> 17:34.390
Doroka. Listen, Doroka.

17:35.280 --> 17:38.000
Thanks for being my friend.

17:39.810 --> 17:41.010
I love you.

17:46.920 --> 17:49.970
No!

17:58.880 --> 18:03.190
<i>HQ to National Security 
Bureau attack force. Report.</i>

18:03.190 --> 18:06.940
<i>We've lost video feed and are unable 
to determine the situation.</i>

18:06.940 --> 18:08.400
<i>Report immediately.</i>

18:08.400 --> 18:13.030
<i>I repeat, we've lost video feed 
and are unable to determine the situation.</i>

18:13.030 --> 18:14.610
<i>Report immediately.</i>

18:19.480 --> 18:23.010
Anna... This can't be happening.

18:24.720 --> 18:27.560
Please, no more!

18:29.480 --> 18:33.210
Why? Why?

18:37.720 --> 18:40.960
I'll kill you, hothead.

18:40.960 --> 18:42.400
Yamato here.

18:42.400 --> 18:44.590
We've successfully neutralized the witches.

18:44.990 --> 18:49.230
All that's left is to exterminate the boy!

18:51.150 --> 18:53.600
Armor-Style: Meta!

18:53.020 --> 18:54.650
<b>Meta</b>

18:53.020 --> 18:54.650
<b>Armor-Style</b>

18:57.970 --> 18:59.490
Wave Strike!

18:59.490 --> 19:04.500
Armor-Style Derivative: 
Zephyr Armor Formula!

19:03.240 --> 19:05.490
<b>Zephyr Armor 
Formula</b>

19:22.430 --> 19:24.160
Execute repairs.

19:25.780 --> 19:27.060
<i>Regenerating blade.</i>

19:29.880 --> 19:33.400
Science, huh? Such crude tricks.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.650
Just like your magic!

19:38.150 --> 19:42.320
We're done for.

19:43.160 --> 19:46.660
D-Don't give up...

19:46.660 --> 19:49.260
The mito is burned to a crisp.

19:49.790 --> 19:54.760
No witches will be born ever again.

19:55.230 --> 19:56.670
We'll go extinct.

19:57.670 --> 20:00.170
Don't give up, everyone!

20:00.680 --> 20:03.430
We can't afford to lose any more of us.

20:03.820 --> 20:07.180
Let's back up Adonis and defeat 
the National Security Bureau—

20:22.950 --> 20:25.200
Maximum electrothermal output!

20:45.380 --> 20:47.640
Is that all the witches can—

20:50.820 --> 20:52.460
Quit screwing around.

20:52.980 --> 20:54.150
Caliburn.

20:55.600 --> 20:57.610
<b>Caliburn</b>

21:03.400 --> 21:05.580
<i>Major damage detected.</i>

21:05.580 --> 21:07.660
Stop the bleeding.

21:11.120 --> 21:13.420
Revenge, huh?

21:13.420 --> 21:17.410
You and I have the same look in our eyes.

21:17.870 --> 21:20.420
Wait. Please wait.

21:20.420 --> 21:22.430
We don't...

21:22.790 --> 21:24.920
I don't even feel like enjoying this.

21:26.550 --> 21:28.830
You're too dangerous.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.490
You must die here.

21:37.250 --> 21:38.600
No.

21:39.590 --> 21:42.820
Die with the witches!

23:16.490 --> 23:20.210
Capital of Redia Empire, New Nightmare

23:20.210 --> 23:23.710
National Science Agency HQ

23:23.970 --> 23:26.720
What happened to 
the guys who led the charge?

23:26.720 --> 23:28.360
Why isn't there any video?

23:28.360 --> 23:31.720
Show us the video, National Science Agency!

23:31.720 --> 23:35.090
All cameras are currently down.

23:35.090 --> 23:36.970
Were they wiped out?

23:36.970 --> 23:38.030
Impossible!

23:38.030 --> 23:40.080
They're the National Security Bureau's best.

23:40.080 --> 23:42.100
Director Yamato is with them.

23:42.100 --> 23:43.320
That can't be.

23:43.730 --> 23:46.690
Y-Yes, sir. One moment, please.

23:47.460 --> 23:50.070
I'm receiving a signal!

23:50.070 --> 23:51.810
Permission granted 
to access transmission line.

23:51.810 --> 23:53.740
Displaying video on monitor.

23:56.480 --> 23:58.200
It's Director Yamato.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.620
Great.

23:59.620 --> 24:02.500
<i>It's me, Yamato.</i>

24:03.600 --> 24:06.500
<i>I have a message for my 
colleagues on the surface.</i>

24:06.880 --> 24:08.880
<i>We've won.</i>

24:09.560 --> 24:11.910
<i>Notify His Majesty right away.</i>

24:12.520 --> 24:14.520
<i>All the witches on the moon's surface...</i>

24:15.760 --> 24:17.560
are dead.

24:18.010 --> 24:21.170
All right!

24:21.170 --> 24:24.780
We won!
